<br/>Unlike the gear set for Combat rogues that uses no tier armor, you'll want to use the  <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=826/terrorblade-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Terrorblade Battlegear</span></a> 2 piece bonus as Assassination. Energy gain is more valuable for Assassination than it is for Combat because Assassination can convert energy to damage more efficiently.<br/>
<br/>For some of these gear slots the best item is much better and a meaningful upgrade over the second best item. For other slots the best and second best options are really not that far apart. Be sure to read on in the individual item sections below to see which pieces are the most important.<br/>
<br/>Many other physical DPS classes will want some of the leather pieces in this set as well for their best in slot setups. If your raid is looking to most effectively upgrade as a team, they should consider giving leather pieces to leather wearers first and mail &amp; plate pieces to the classes that can use them. The sooner the mail or plate users are given leather BIS pieces, the sooner the mail and plate alternatives they could have used become wasted loot that no one needs.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Assassination Rogue DPS Phase 2</h3>Only the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46125/conquerors-terrorblade-helmet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Terrorblade Helmet</span></a> is a best in slot piece among the items you can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>, making it a easy choice as first item to buy. The next two listed options <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46123/conquerors-terrorblade-breastplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Terrorblade Breastplate</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45829/belt-of-the-twilight-assassin">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Twilight Assassin</span></a> are both second-best pieces only replaced by 10 or 25 man hard mode boss drops.<br/>
