<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Assassination Rogue DPS Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Assassination Rogue DPS Phase 2</h3>For both the helmet and glove slots, you will not use the individually strongest item and instead opt for the tier piece in order to activate the very strong 2 piece bonus. For the helmet  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45523/garonas-guise">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100-tga.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Garona's Guise</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45993/mimirons-flight-goggles">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mimiron's Flight Goggles</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45893/guise-of-the-midgard-serpent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100-tga.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Guise of the Midgard Serpent</span></a> are all individually stronger items than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46125/conquerors-terrorblade-helmet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Terrorblade Helmet</span></a>, but the set bonus makes it worth using the Conquerer's Terrorblade Helmet.<br/>
<br/>You'll want to replace one of the many <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39999/bright-scarlet-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bright Scarlet Ruby</span></a> in your armor with a single <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45879/delicate-stormjewel">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Delicate Stormjewel</span></a>. Here it is done in the helmet, but it doesn't really matter what piece of armor this gem is put into, just that you fit it in somewhere in your gear set for a nice bonus 4 agility.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50367/arcanum-of-torment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_rampage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Torment</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1098/knights-of-the-ebon-blade">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Knights of the Ebon Blade</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
