<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Assassination Rogue DPS Phase 2</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-assassination-rogue-dps-phase-2">Weapons for Assassination Rogue DPS Phase 2</h4>For Assassination rogues, we don't have a clear distinction between what is a good weapon for the mainhand and a good weapon for the offhand. Most of the time you are looking for a fast mainhand weapon with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57973/deadly-poison-ix">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_dualweild.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Poison IX</span></a> and a offhand that is either fast or slow with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57968/instant-poison-ix">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_poisons.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Instant Poison IX</span></a> - but how you setup your weapons will always depend on the particular weapons you have access to.<br/>
<br/>With the dagger options available in Phase 2, the main theme is that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45484/bladetwister">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bladetwister</span></a> is really good. Your best weapon setup will just be two Bladetwisters - but Combat and Subtlety rogues will also be after one Bladetwister each, so it may be hard to get your hands on two of them. The second best option is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45930/combatants-bootblade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_79.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Combatant's Bootblade</span></a>, and Bladetwister + Bladetwister is only a small upgrade over Bladetwister + Bootblade.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
