<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_crossbow_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyforge Crossbow</span></a> comes in as a small upgrade over the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45296/twirling-blades">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingknife_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twirling Blades</span></a>, which are almost identical in performance to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45870/magnetized-projectile-emitter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magnetized Projectile Emitter</span></a>. Like the rings, this is another slot where securing the best available option just isn't that important - the difference between the choices are all quite small.<br/>
<br/>
